  "rationale": {
    "primary": "4:5 (1080x1350) claims more vertical feed real estate on Instagram, giving room to run 4 distinct, scannable benefit bullets with clear iconography — this reads as a genuine sales/product-presentation layout rather than a vague teaser. The dark navy + single cyan accent palette matches the brand personality ('polida e confiável') and keeps the ERP/certification-digital audience's expectation of a trustworthy, technical-but-approachable tool. Integration is visually promoted as the first bullet (bullet-1, tagged emphasis: primary-differentiator) since it's the core differentiator.",
    "variant": "1:1 (1080x1080) square tests a punchier, more compact read — condensed bullets in a single soft-panel block, warm coral/magenta accent instead of cyan, and a shorter, more declarative headline. Useful to A/B against the primary for feed thumbnail scroll-stopping power while keeping the same benefit content and CTA."
  },

